  "Tilt your device to move around the map and head for the exit tile.\nThe gauge in the corner shows your tilt: dashed ring to walk, solid ring to run.": "倾斜设备即可移动，前往出口地砖。\n角落的指示器显示倾斜程度：超过虚线圈走路，超过实线圈奔跑。",
  "Stepping on this tile will reverse the controls.\nStep on another and they go back to normal.": "踩到这块地砖会反转操作。\n再踩一块就会恢复正常。",
  "Stepping on this tile will make Map Man disappear.\nDon't worry, after a few moves he will show up again.": "踩到这块地砖，Map Man会隐身。\n别担心，走几步他就会再次现身。",
  "Stepping on this tile will cause Map Man to get stuck.\nShake your device to free him and get moving again.": "踩到这块地砖，Map Man会被困住。\n摇一摇设备就能让他脱困，继续前进。",
  "Watch out for bonus points,\nalthough you may have to go out of your way to get them.": "留意奖励分，\n不过要拿到它们可能得绕远路。",
  "Also keep an eye out for extra lives,\nbut take care as they will take you\neven more off course than bonus points.": "也要留意额外生命，\n不过要小心，为了拿到它们\n你得绕的路比奖励分还远。",
  "Be careful of the poison tiles: if you step on them you will lose a life.": "小心毒地砖，踩到就会失去一条生命。",
  "These tiles crumble away once you step off them.\nThere is no going back, so plan the way ahead.": "离开这些地砖后，它们就会碎裂掉落。\n没有回头路，所以请提前规划路线。",
  "Spikes rise and fall on a beat, with a warning first.\nWait for them to drop, then cross before they rise again.": "尖刺会先发出警示，然后有节奏地升降。\n等它们落下后再通过，赶在再次升起之前。",
  "Ice sends you sliding until a plain tile or the edge stops you.\nYou can't steer on it, so line up before you set off.": "踩上冰面会一直滑行，直到被普通地砖或边缘挡住。\n滑行时无法转向，所以出发前先对准方向。",
  "These tiles will give you extra time or cost you time. You will get bonus points for time left on the clock when you finish each level.": "这些地砖会增加或减少你的时间。每关结束时，剩余时间会换算成奖励分。",
  "These tiles cause other tiles to disappear and reappear. When the tiles are hidden you can still step on them so remember where they are.": "这些地砖会让其他地砖消失再重现。地砖隐藏时仍然可以踩，所以要记住它们的位置。",
  "Every so often you'll come across a checkpoint. Each time you reach a checkpoint you can restart from there instead of going back to the beginning.": "你会时不时遇到检查点。每到达一个检查点，就可以从那里重新开始，而不必回到起点。",
  "Tap the screen during play to pause. Holding your device a new way? Tap the corner gauge to set that as the new centre.": "游戏中点击屏幕即可暂停。换了握持姿势？点击角落的指示器，即可将当前角度设为新的中心。",
  "You're all set, head for the exit to start the game. Have fun!": "一切就绪，前往出口开始游戏吧。玩得开心！",
